      "content": "but i really dont want to spend money on a doctor's visit if i can avoid it. i know it's not a full course or anything but i have like 5 pills left... if i just take one or two a day for a bit, wouldn't that at least help kill off whatever is starting? it's better than just sitting here feeling like this.",
